&h=200&s=ef26ffc8ce9d6a5a827e09b564d45305 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/85bc2e69/uploads/origins/bf3688a2-f960-4c39-bbc2-ed5e6aa64c4c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c9a5cfa5fca408c570fee38989d60243", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/85bc2e69/uploads/origins/bf3688a2-f960-4c39-bbc2-ed5e6aa64c4c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c9a5cfa5fca408c570fee38989d60243, https://si.imgix.net/85bc2e69/uploads/origins/bf3688a2-f960-4c39-bbc2-ed5e6aa64c4c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=15dfe8cdeb7afd847200a36da4c0607a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/85bc2e69/uploads/origins/bf3688a2-f960-4c39-bbc2-ed5e6aa64c4c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=979a12aec72696b03ca5dadade81078e 3x"}, "body": "Hello qks-san! It's nice to meet you too \ud83d\udc4b\nThank you for your appeal and for your interest in Rinko, I'm glad that you like her\n\nI don't have anything specific in mind, so I'll leave the details up to you \ud83d\ude4f\n\nYou can find more details and art (\u30ae\u30e3\u30e9\u30ea\u30fc) for her on my site here:\nRinko (\u51db\u604b): https://argentumgaleria.carrd.co/#sasashi-rinko\n\nI'm looking forward to your work \ud83d\udc97", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@qks2_/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1749506, "client_id": 103062, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f02a2693/uploads/origins/3cfe8cb1-ccd7-408e-9a92-b501b8994d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2199e737efafc630f2da448ca1a6e316", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f02a2693/uploads/origins/3cfe8cb1-ccd7-408e-9a92-b501b8994d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2199e737efafc630f2da448ca1a6e316, https://si.imgix.net/f02a2693/uploads/origins/3cfe8cb1-ccd7-408e-9a92-b501b8994d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9bbe7ac25f315b15b1012770eb4a3284 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f02a2693/uploads/origins/3cfe8cb1-ccd7-408e-9a92-b501b8994d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73ce1ca520694890fb750799731ca2c4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f02a2693/uploads/origins/3cfe8cb1-ccd7-408e-9a92-b501b8994d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5395a5b88e100401100ffc8e6867f993", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f02a2693/uploads/origins/3cfe8cb1-ccd7-408e-9a92-b501b8994d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5395a5b88e100401100ffc8e6867f993, https://si.imgix.net/f02a2693/uploads/origins/3cfe8cb1-ccd7-408e-9a92-b501b8994d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d8cfb257241538338c4c58e38253a57a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f02a2693/uploads/origins/3cfe8cb1-ccd7-408e-9a92-b501b8994d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ad72eeaf90a9c21caf7fe785c88b37c9 3x"}, "body": "I have read your appeal.\nI would like to ask for Onsen Musume \"Asamushi Yunagi\".\n\nI would like to ask you to draw \"Asamushi Yunagi,\" a hot spring musume, since Shugao-san, the original designer, is a kemomimi artist,\nPlease draw her as if she were a \"chemomimi\" character without showing the so-called \"human ear\" part.\n-The double teeth are on the left side (right side towards the viewer).\n-The left side (right side toward you) has a double tooth.\n\nhttps://onsen-musume.jp/character/asamushi_yuuna", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@qks2_/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1749506, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e57f049a/uploads/origins/f011c7d8-5e4a-4927-9f83-9f170e7cb04d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=550281d75e86a88a066828de27c0a06d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e57f049a/uploads/origins/f011c7d8-5e4a-4927-9f83-9f170e7cb04d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=550281d75e86a88a066828de27c0a06d, https://si.imgix.net/e57f049a/uploads/origins/f011c7d8-5e4a-4927-9f83-9f170e7cb04d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=941a21a128b3274cc0a6ddbf572283b7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e57f049a/uploads/origins/f011c7d8-5e4a-4927-9f83-9f170e7cb04d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68b40ef9ec7e71ca4be7a250dafc6630 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e57f049a/uploads/origins/f011c7d8-5e4a-4927-9f83-9f170e7cb04d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=11ef3016d8e89cef1e9de9e89cd860d2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e57f049a/uploads/origins/f011c7d8-5e4a-4927-9f83-9f170e7cb04d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=11ef3016d8e89cef1e9de9e89cd860d2, https://si.imgix.net/e57f049a/uploads/origins/f011c7d8-5e4a-4927-9f83-9f170e7cb04d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a1f1282f400d487f91226cbf548bb21c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e57f049a/uploads/origins/f011c7d8-5e4a-4927-9f83-9f170e7cb04d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5f08558c09d91a5c85b0b3857bacdcc6 3x"}, "body": "Thank you for your appeal.\nThank you for your interest in the character.\n\nWe would like to ask you to illustrate a girl similar to the one in the original appeal.\nThis is a reference image, but you are free to design, express, pose, and compose the sailor uniform.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RIJ2bUUoPHZDhYmSZ5NlFco0yYrqRyDg?usp=sharing\n\nBelow is the content of the request.\n\nGirl\nShe has glossy black hair with bangs, a short bob curled slightly inward, side and back hair trimmed at about the mouth line, and a softly cropped collar (may or may not be visible depending on the composition).\nSailor uniform with short sleeves\nShort-sleeved sailor uniform\nSituation\nThe right arm is in a cast and is hanging from the neck with a triangular bandage.\n\u3000-Please place the knot of the triangular bandage at the neck and elbow in a visible position (please refer to the URL of the document).\n\u3000\u3000(This is a minor detail...the neck has one knot and two ends of the triangular bandage, while the elbow has one knot and one end of the triangular bandage.)\n\u3000-Please make sure that the right arm is in the frame.\nOne adhesive bandage on the cheek.\n-An expression of embarrassment, not darkened by the injury, as shown below.\n\u3000Wink with one eye, sticking out tongue, so-called \"tehepe-roku\" expression.\n\nMy personal point is to moe for the bandage and still look cute and energetic.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iLDkTBdxs4w", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@qks2_/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1749506, "client_id": 1727055, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/01c0031d/uploads/origins/4a7c7d0a-3f21-4399-8a03-b3d4f0808c9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba1caa9c0dac3dcf87140fb269ef5e9c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/01c0031d/uploads/orig